        "title": "Twilite — Product Projection",
        "markdown": "## Twilite\n\nA canvas projection created from the Legend and rendered through Twilite's product/default surface.\n\nIts **document** handle intentionally requests another projection of this same Twilite identity and type using the exposed document surface.",
