        "title": "Interaction Boundary",
        "markdown": "## Identity and presentation rule\n\n- **Bridge:** contributes Twilite creation capability to the focused graph.\n- **Legend:** creates the first Twilite canvas projection.\n- **Document handle:** requests a named view projection, not a new semantic type.\n- **Both visible nodes:** share Twilite's addressed identity and semantic type but have distinct canvas projection IDs.\n- **Presentation:** the first selects the product/default surface; the second is pinned to the document surface.\n- **Semantic zoom:** applies to the projections, not to the bridge or port interface."
      }
    },
